Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I put one habit down, watched the dust settle slow,\NThought the storm had passed me, thought I was good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a different hunger started knocking at my door,\NSame old ache in new clothes, like I'd met this ghost before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Different label, same flame,\NDifferent road, same rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not broken, I am learning\NHow the pattern calls my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NTrigger to craving, back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:01:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Short relief, then the weight comes through,\NI am not failing, I am seeing what is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NBut I can slow it, I can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One clear pause, one honest breath,\NAnd I choose a different step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress at midnight, loneliness at two,\NBoredom in the morning finds a shortcut to undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be food, could be scrolling, could be spending for a spark,\NCould be work, could be nicotine, anything to dodge the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:02:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind learned survival\NFrom whatever eased the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I teach it something gentler,\NNot perfection - just a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Map the hour, map the feeling, map the places I get pulled,\NBuild a rhythm, build a refuge, make the empty moments full.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If withdrawal risk is rising, I reach for medical hands,\NAnd for the deeper pattern work, I heal where it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypnotherapy for the pause,\NEFT to calm the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Small repeats become a pathway,\NAnd that pathway starts to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NI know the pattern, I know the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trigger to craving does not own me now,\NI meet it with awareness anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Same brain, new patterns, day by day,\NI am finding my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What once was automatic can be relearned in time,\NSame loop, new name - new ending, mine.
